# Backup schedule, in IST (TZ is set on the backup container).
# Weekly full and daily differential database backups; WAL is archived
# continuously by Postgres itself.
30 2 * * 0    duis-backup pgbackrest full
30 2 * * 1-6  duis-backup pgbackrest diff
# Nightly logical dump and the media volume, through restic.
30 3 * * *    duis-backup nightly
# Weekly retention, pruning and a partial read-back of the restic repository.
0 5 * * 0     duis-backup prune
30 5 * * 0    duis-backup check
